    "date": 1744377901,
    "caption": "🚀 Female Founders Invest Day at Astana Hub!\n\nOn April 10, Astana Hub and @womenintech_kz came together to host an incredible event — Female Founders Invest Day! This unique platform brought together top women-led startups and global VCs 🌍\n\n✨ From 45 applications, 12 powerful startups were selected to pitch in front of a jury of investors from Central Asia, Europe, MENA & beyond — including: Antler Middle East, S60 (Saudi Arabia), Constructor Accelerator (Germany), Astana Hub Ventures, Sturgeon Capital (UK), MyVentures, InvestBanq (Singapore), and many more 🌟\n\nThese startups covered everything from: 📊 FinTech\n📚 EdTech\n🧬 HealthTech\n🌱 Sustainable Tech\n👩‍⚕️ FemTech\n🧠 AI & Big Data\n🔒 SafetyTech\n💼 CareerTech\n\nWhat truly stood out? Many of these women founders are tackling real social issues through innovation — from healthcare and education to quality of life \n\n💬 Each team received expert feedback from VCs to fine-tune their pitches, sharpen business models, and scale smarter!\n\nThis was our second women-focused pitch event at Astana Hub — and the momentum is only growing! 🚀 The strong interest from investors and founders proves: the future of tech is female-led.\n\n👩‍💻 At Astana Hub, we’re committed to building a stronger, more inclusive IT ecosystem — and YES, we’re dreaming big: the next unicorn may just be founded by a woman.",
